      "text": "The methods must link every HCI question to timed, tool-specific user-data collection and analysis; distinguish prototype instability from design failure; and avoid treating feature lists as contributions. Preregistered deviations require permitted conditions and records, while safety procedures override collection. One exact participant target must consistently determine sessions, staffing, payments, schedule, and budget; shortfalls must be disclosed with affected plans revised, not deferred through ranges."
